Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:44:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LineageParts: name ExpressiveOS in the titles and security
 text

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the settings title, the privacy category,
the easter egg title and the security patch explanation still named
Evolution X (or LineageOS in a few translations).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
